[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.02,
    "text": "Oh my goodness, I can't believe that I'm doing this."
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "start": 5.02,
    "end": 9.5,
    "text": "Chick with social anxiety about to go talk to a couple billion or millionaires."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "start": 12.45,
    "end": 16.21,
    "text": "First in the tank is a stylish and functional accessory."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "start": 27.28,
    "end": 29.92,
    "text": "I'm Sophie Overton. I'm from Bentonville, Arkansas,"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "start": 29.92,
    "end": 33.44,
    "text": "and I am seeking $30,000 for 15% equity in my company."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "start": 34.32,
    "end": 37.92,
    "text": "Sharks, I'm 13 years old. And even though I'm still in the eighth grade,"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "start": 37.92,
    "end": 42.64,
    "text": "I have a PhD in sockology. Heck, I know more about thread counts than I do about"
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "start": 42.64,
    "end": 43.8,
    "text": "the periodic table."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "start": 43.8,
    "end": 46.56,
    "text": "I created a sock for kids made by this kid"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "start": 46.56,
    "end": 49.04,
    "text": "to make life easier for whatever we're doing."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "start": 49.04,
    "end": 51.92,
    "text": "Introducing Wise Pocket Products,"
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "start": 51.92,
    "end": 55.88,
    "text": "an innovative line of socks and leggings with pockets in them."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "start": 55.88,
    "end": 58.72,
    "text": "Big enough for kids' most important items, like your phone,"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "start": 58.72,
    "end": 60.6,
    "text": "so you don't have to worry about the life-threatening event"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "start": 60.6,
    "end": 62.84,
    "text": "of missing a call or text from your mom anymore."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "start": 62.84,
    "end": 64.32,
    "text": "And I know what you're probably thinking."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "start": 64.32,
    "end": 66.48,
    "text": "There's gotta be tons of socks like this."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": 66.48,
    "end": 68.84,
    "text": "Well, I created a patent-pending sock design"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": 68.84,
    "end": 71.16,
    "text": "for kids to safely stick their important items"
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": 71.16,
    "end": 72.92,
    "text": "into our sock pockets."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": 72.92,
    "end": 77.0,
    "text": "So if you're playing soccer, rock climbing,"
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "start": 78.0,
    "end": 80.24,
    "text": "or, you know, spontaneously breaking out"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "start": 80.24,
    "end": 81.62,
    "text": "and to dance with your friends,"
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "start": 81.62,
    "end": 88.13,
    "text": "why is Pocket Products as you covered it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "start": 88.13,
    "end": 94.81,
    "text": "Whoa."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "start": 94.81,
    "end": 115.63,
    "text": "Nice."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "start": 115.63,
    "end": 116.47,
    "text": "Love you guys."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "start": 116.47,
    "end": 117.31,
    "text": "Nice."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "start": 117.31,
    "end": 118.15,
    "text": "Are you alive?"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "start": 118.15,
    "end": 119.39,
    "text": "Just like my Zumba class."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "start": 119.39,
    "end": 120.71,
    "text": "I just wanna let you guys know"
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "start": 120.71,
    "end": 122.99,
    "text": "you're all gonna have arthritis when you get old."
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "start": 122.99,
    "end": 125.91,
    "text": "So as you can see sharks,"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "start": 125.91,
    "end": 128.35,
    "text": "even after all that, our design sock pockets"
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "start": 128.35,
    "end": 130.15,
    "text": "will keep your important items in."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "start": 130.15,
    "end": 132.31,
    "text": "without falling out."
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "start": 132.31,
    "end": 134.91,
    "text": "And the best part is, for every pair of socks that we sell,"
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "start": 134.91,
    "end": 137.73,
    "text": "we donate a pair of socks to kids in need."
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "start": 137.73,
    "end": 140.35,
    "text": "Sharks, I know I'm young, but give me five years,"
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "start": 140.35,
    "end": 142.79,
    "text": "and I hope I'll be sitting in one of those shares."
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "start": 142.79,
    "end": 144.87,
    "text": "So tell me, who's wise enough to join me"
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "start": 144.87,
    "end": 147.51,
    "text": "in getting wise pocket products to kids everywhere?"
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "start": 147.51,
    "end": 149.15,
    "text": "Thank you for letting me tell you about wise."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "start": 149.15,
    "end": 150.35,
    "text": "And thanks, guys."
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "start": 150.35,
    "end": 151.19,
    "text": "All right, good job."
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "start": 151.19,
    "end": 152.03,
    "text": "All right, thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "start": 152.03,
    "end": 153.07,
    "text": "Good job, guys."
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "start": 153.07,
    "end": 154.59,
    "text": "Excellent, excellent, excellent."
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "start": 154.59,
    "end": 156.71,
    "text": "You're going to show us some Sophie in person here?"
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "start": 156.71,
    "end": 160.5,
    "text": "Yeah, sure."
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "start": 160.5,
    "end": 162.86,
    "text": "Here you go, you can take three."
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "start": 162.86,
    "end": 163.7,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "start": 164.82,
    "end": 165.82,
    "text": "You take eight."
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "start": 165.82,
    "end": 167.02,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "start": 167.02,
    "end": 168.06,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "start": 168.06,
    "end": 169.1,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "start": 169.1,
    "end": 170.38,
    "text": "Nice color, so, huh?"
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "start": 171.34,
    "end": 172.22,
    "text": "Thanks, Sophie."
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "start": 172.22,
    "end": 173.42,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "start": 173.42,
    "end": 176.82,
    "text": "Tell us about you, how you got into this business."
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "start": 176.82,
    "end": 180.06,
    "text": "Well, I got into this business when I was 11"
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "start": 180.06,
    "end": 183.1,
    "text": "and my cousin put her phone in her boot"
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "start": 183.1,
    "end": 185.18,
    "text": "because, you know, kids in women's clothing"
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "start": 185.18,
    "end": 188.06,
    "text": "don't have pockets, so I tried it too"
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "start": 188.06,
    "end": 189.34,
    "text": "and it was really uncomfortable"
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "start": 189.34,
    "end": 193.74,
    "text": "because it slipped down to my ankle and I couldn't reach it"
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "start": 193.74,
    "end": 197.38,
    "text": "and it was just all in all a bad idea."
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "start": 197.38,
    "end": 199.5,
    "text": "And so I asked her on my school"
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "start": 199.5,
    "end": 202.78,
    "text": "to see if other kids had this problem and they did."
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "start": 202.78,
    "end": 205.78,
    "text": "And so I came up with my prototype"
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "start": 205.78,
    "end": 209.42,
    "text": "where I cut off the top of another sock"
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "start": 209.42,
    "end": 211.14,
    "text": "and stuck it inside the sock."
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "start": 211.14,
    "end": 211.98,
    "text": "That's cool."
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "start": 211.98,
    "end": 214.5,
    "text": "And I sewed it up the sides and voila."
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "start": 214.5,
    "end": 216.42,
    "text": "How did you get your money for the business?"
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "start": 216.42,
    "end": 218.7,
    "text": "I save everything that I earn"
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "start": 218.7,
    "end": 219.54,
    "text": "and I-"
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "start": 219.54,
    "end": 222.18,
    "text": "How much money did you actually put in to make your socks?"
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "start": 222.18,
    "end": 225.66,
    "text": "I invested 10,000 of my own money."
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "start": 225.66,
    "end": 226.66,
    "text": "10,000?"
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "start": 226.66,
    "end": 227.5,
    "text": "10,000?"
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "start": 227.5,
    "end": 230.06,
    "text": "I think your parents overpaid you for your job."
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "start": 230.06,
    "end": 231.98,
    "text": "No, I'd saved 5,000,"
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "start": 231.98,
    "end": 235.22,
    "text": "and I earned 5,000 more through business pitches"
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "start": 235.22,
    "end": 236.22,
    "text": "and competitions."
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "start": 236.22,
    "end": 237.06,
    "text": "Nice."
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "start": 237.06,
    "end": 237.9,
    "text": "Oh, wow."
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "start": 237.9,
    "end": 239.46,
    "text": "Good for you."
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "start": 239.46,
    "end": 241.62,
    "text": "Have you been watching Shark Tank very long?"
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "start": 241.62,
    "end": 243.14,
    "text": "Since I was like six years old."
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "start": 243.14,
    "end": 243.98,
    "text": "Oh my gosh."
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "start": 243.98,
    "end": 244.82,
    "text": "Oh my gosh."
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "start": 244.82,
    "end": 245.98,
    "text": "You know, I'd stand up in the living room and say,"
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "start": 245.98,
    "end": 247.34,
    "text": "I'm gonna be on Shark Tank."
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "start": 247.34,
    "end": 249.62,
    "text": "This has been my goal since before I even had"
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "start": 249.62,
    "end": 251.82,
    "text": "the idea for the business."
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "start": 251.82,
    "end": 253.32,
    "text": "You sold any of these yet?"
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "start": 253.32,
    "end": 254.14,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "start": 254.14,
    "end": 254.98,
    "text": "How much?"
  },
  {
    "id": 99,
    "start": 254.98,
    "end": 256.54,
    "text": "A little under $16,000 in sales."
  },
  {
    "id": 100,
    "start": 256.54,
    "end": 257.66,
    "text": "Sophie, let me just tell you,"
  },
  {
    "id": 101,
    "start": 257.66,
    "end": 259.86,
    "text": "you're a perfect example of what every kid"
  },
  {
    "id": 102,
    "start": 259.86,
    "end": 261.62,
    "text": "pernure should do, right?"
  },
  {
    "id": 103,
    "start": 261.62,
    "end": 264.34,
    "text": "You got a job, you saved up some money,"
  },
  {
    "id": 104,
    "start": 264.34,
    "end": 266.72,
    "text": "you did all the prototypes yourself,"
  },
  {
    "id": 105,
    "start": 266.72,
    "end": 268.66,
    "text": "then you made actual products,"
  },
  {
    "id": 106,
    "start": 268.66,
    "end": 273.66,
    "text": "then you sold those products $16,000 worth of products."
  },
  {
    "id": 107,
    "start": 273.66,
    "end": 274.78,
    "text": "Now the only question is,"
  },
  {
    "id": 108,
    "start": 274.78,
    "end": 276.98,
    "text": "did you sell those products profitably?"
  },
  {
    "id": 109,
    "start": 276.98,
    "end": 279.46,
    "text": "Tell us what it cost you to make a sock"
  },
  {
    "id": 110,
    "start": 279.46,
    "end": 281.46,
    "text": "and what you're selling them for."
  },
  {
    "id": 111,
    "start": 281.46,
    "end": 284.26,
    "text": "To make the sock, it's $5.47."
  },
  {
    "id": 112,
    "start": 284.26,
    "end": 285.26,
    "text": "Because that's expensive."
  },
  {
    "id": 113,
    "start": 285.26,
    "end": 287.38,
    "text": "Yes, it's because of the process"
  },
  {
    "id": 114,
    "start": 287.38,
    "end": 290.34,
    "text": "to make the double welt for my pocket."
  },
  {
    "id": 115,
    "start": 290.34,
    "end": 291.46,
    "text": "What are you selling for?"
  },
  {
    "id": 116,
    "start": 291.46,
    "end": 294.78,
    "text": "$15 retail and $11 wholesale."
  },
  {
    "id": 117,
    "start": 294.78,
    "end": 296.86,
    "text": "What do you want with the $30,000, Sophia?"
  },
  {
    "id": 118,
    "start": 296.86,
    "end": 297.78,
    "text": "What are you going to do with it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 119,
    "start": 297.78,
    "end": 301.06,
    "text": "Well, my main goal is to streamline the production"
  },
  {
    "id": 120,
    "start": 301.06,
    "end": 303.74,
    "text": "because right now I'm only able to produce"
  },
  {
    "id": 121,
    "start": 303.74,
    "end": 306.42,
    "text": "around 100 units per month because I have..."
  },
  {
    "id": 122,
    "start": 306.42,
    "end": 307.86,
    "text": "A month?"
  },
  {
    "id": 123,
    "start": 307.86,
    "end": 308.26,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "id": 124,
    "start": 308.26,
    "end": 309.38,
    "text": "That's horrible."
  },
  {
    "id": 125,
    "start": 309.38,
    "end": 312.5,
    "text": "So there's other things out there on the market"
  },
  {
    "id": 126,
    "start": 312.5,
    "end": 314.06,
    "text": "that hold in socks."
  },
  {
    "id": 127,
    "start": 314.06,
    "end": 315.46,
    "text": "They have pockets, right?"
  },
  {
    "id": 128,
    "start": 315.46,
    "end": 318.66,
    "text": "I do have competition, although my competitors"
  },
  {
    "id": 129,
    "start": 318.66,
    "end": 322.66,
    "text": "only have small pockets for keys and stuff."
  },
  {
    "id": 130,
    "start": 322.66,
    "end": 324.26,
    "text": "Well, Sophie, look, I love what you're doing."
  },
  {
    "id": 131,
    "start": 324.26,
    "end": 326.5,
    "text": "And it's wonderful to see this at such a young age."
  },
  {
    "id": 132,
    "start": 326.5,
    "end": 329.38,
    "text": "But I don't want a sock company in my portfolio."
  },
  {
    "id": 133,
    "start": 329.38,
    "end": 331.98,
    "text": "So I'm out."
  },
  {
    "id": 134,
    "start": 331.98,
    "end": 332.74,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 135,
    "start": 332.74,
    "end": 334.54,
    "text": "Sophie, I think it's a great idea."
  },
  {
    "id": 136,
    "start": 334.54,
    "end": 336.66,
    "text": "I'm gonna get some for my kids."
  },
  {
    "id": 137,
    "start": 336.66,
    "end": 338.96,
    "text": "For me though, it's not a great fit as an investment"
  },
  {
    "id": 138,
    "start": 338.96,
    "end": 340.94,
    "text": "simply because this isn't my strength."
  },
  {
    "id": 139,
    "start": 340.94,
    "end": 344.22,
    "text": "I couldn't tell you about thread counts, you know."
  },
  {
    "id": 140,
    "start": 344.22,
    "end": 346.78,
    "text": "But I mean, congratulations."
  },
  {
    "id": 141,
    "start": 346.78,
    "end": 348.94,
    "text": "You should be so proud, but it's not a fit for me."
  },
  {
    "id": 142,
    "start": 348.94,
    "end": 351.38,
    "text": "So for those reasons, I'm out."
  },
  {
    "id": 143,
    "start": 351.38,
    "end": 352.26,
    "text": "Thank you very much."
  },
  {
    "id": 144,
    "start": 352.26,
    "end": 353.78,
    "text": "Congrats though, Sophie."
  },
  {
    "id": 145,
    "start": 353.78,
    "end": 356.46,
    "text": "Do you feel that you want to be"
  },
  {
    "id": 146,
    "start": 356.46,
    "end": 358.38,
    "text": "running a business right now?"
  },
  {
    "id": 147,
    "start": 358.38,
    "end": 360.66,
    "text": "Or is it a little stressful"
  },
  {
    "id": 148,
    "start": 360.66,
    "end": 363.66,
    "text": "when you're going to school and all of that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 149,
    "start": 363.66,
    "end": 366.86,
    "text": "I mean, going into high school is stressful on its own,"
  },
  {
    "id": 150,
    "start": 366.86,
    "end": 369.38,
    "text": "but with the Wise Pocket product,"
  },
  {
    "id": 151,
    "start": 369.38,
    "end": 370.82,
    "text": "it's kind of a boost for me."
  },
  {
    "id": 152,
    "start": 370.82,
    "end": 372.58,
    "text": "I feel a confidence boost."
  },
  {
    "id": 153,
    "start": 372.58,
    "end": 374.38,
    "text": "Like if I can own a business,"
  },
  {
    "id": 154,
    "start": 374.38,
    "end": 377.86,
    "text": "then I can go through school and turn in that essay."
  },
  {
    "id": 155,
    "start": 377.86,
    "end": 379.06,
    "text": "Good for you Sophie."
  },
  {
    "id": 156,
    "start": 379.06,
    "end": 380.06,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 157,
    "start": 380.06,
    "end": 381.98,
    "text": "You're already out there hustling, thinking,"
  },
  {
    "id": 158,
    "start": 381.98,
    "end": 384.0,
    "text": "creating, doing it yourself."
  },
  {
    "id": 159,
    "start": 384.0,
    "end": 386.46,
    "text": "So you've got everything that it takes"
  },
  {
    "id": 160,
    "start": 386.46,
    "end": 388.62,
    "text": "to really be a great entrepreneur."
  },
  {
    "id": 161,
    "start": 388.62,
    "end": 393.62,
    "text": "And Damon and I wanna help you."
  },
  {
    "id": 162,
    "start": 393.62,
    "end": 396.5,
    "text": "He does quite a bit in the soccer arena,"
  },
  {
    "id": 163,
    "start": 396.5,
    "end": 401.1,
    "text": "and he would like to do an offer with me."
  },
  {
    "id": 164,
    "start": 401.1,
    "end": 403.26,
    "text": "I started off with bombs, they would do an 800,000,"
  },
  {
    "id": 165,
    "start": 403.26,
    "end": 405.02,
    "text": "and they were donating to people,"
  },
  {
    "id": 166,
    "start": 405.02,
    "end": 407.18,
    "text": "and they would donate over 10 million pairs of socks,"
  },
  {
    "id": 167,
    "start": 407.18,
    "end": 409.18,
    "text": "and they're doing 120 million now."
  },
  {
    "id": 168,
    "start": 409.18,
    "end": 411.98,
    "text": "And the donation is way more important to them"
  },
  {
    "id": 169,
    "start": 411.98,
    "end": 413.06,
    "text": "than the money."
  },
  {
    "id": 170,
    "start": 413.06,
    "end": 416.82,
    "text": "So what do you think, Lori?"
  },
  {
    "id": 171,
    "start": 416.82,
    "end": 420.26,
    "text": "We'll do the $30,000."
  },
  {
    "id": 172,
    "start": 420.26,
    "end": 425.22,
    "text": "We'll be a third partner."
  },
  {
    "id": 173,
    "start": 425.22,
    "end": 429.06,
    "text": "Our goal is to try to find somebody to license it."
  },
  {
    "id": 174,
    "start": 429.06,
    "end": 430.78,
    "text": "And then when we get to that point,"
  },
  {
    "id": 175,
    "start": 430.78,
    "end": 433.5,
    "text": "we'll figure out what the licensing deal is."
  },
  {
    "id": 176,
    "start": 433.5,
    "end": 435.38,
    "text": "Do you want to take the $30,000"
  },
  {
    "id": 177,
    "start": 435.38,
    "end": 437.66,
    "text": "and give up one third of your company?"
  },
  {
    "id": 178,
    "start": 437.66,
    "end": 442.45,
    "text": "You got to make a decision, yes or no?"
  },
  {
    "id": 179,
    "start": 442.45,
    "end": 444.25,
    "text": "You are right, Mr. Wonderful."
  },
  {
    "id": 180,
    "start": 444.25,
    "end": 446.61,
    "text": "It's a lot of my company."
  },
  {
    "id": 181,
    "start": 446.61,
    "end": 448.85,
    "text": "I'd like to make a counter offer."
  },
  {
    "id": 182,
    "start": 448.85,
    "end": 449.85,
    "text": "Yeah, Sophie."
  },
  {
    "id": 183,
    "start": 449.85,
    "end": 453.25,
    "text": "OK, let's hear it."
  },
  {
    "id": 184,
    "start": 453.25,
    "end": 457.37,
    "text": "$35,000 for 25%."
  },
  {
    "id": 185,
    "start": 457.37,
    "end": 458.21,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "id": 186,
    "start": 458.21,
    "end": 459.03,
    "text": "Woo!"
  },
  {
    "id": 187,
    "start": 460.03,
    "end": 461.25,
    "text": "Well, well, well."
  },
  {
    "id": 188,
    "start": 461.25,
    "end": 463.45,
    "text": "Sophie's got negotiating skills."
  },
  {
    "id": 189,
    "start": 463.45,
    "end": 464.29,
    "text": "So you're going up."
  },
  {
    "id": 190,
    "start": 464.29,
    "end": 467.61,
    "text": "She got a little switchblade in her sock on that one, huh?"
  },
  {
    "id": 191,
    "start": 467.61,
    "end": 475.71,
    "text": "25%."
  },
  {
    "id": 192,
    "start": 475.71,
    "end": 477.07,
    "text": "We will take that offer."
  },
  {
    "id": 193,
    "start": 477.07,
    "end": 478.19,
    "text": "Thank you so much."
  },
  {
    "id": 194,
    "start": 478.19,
    "end": 479.03,
    "text": "Yay!"
  },
  {
    "id": 195,
    "start": 479.03,
    "end": 479.87,
    "text": "Oh my god."
  },
  {
    "id": 196,
    "start": 479.87,
    "end": 480.71,
    "text": "Yay."
  },
  {
    "id": 197,
    "start": 480.71,
    "end": 481.55,
    "text": "We're in the sock business again."
  },
  {
    "id": 198,
    "start": 481.55,
    "end": 482.39,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "id": 199,
    "start": 482.39,
    "end": 483.23,
    "text": "High five."
  },
  {
    "id": 200,
    "start": 483.23,
    "end": 484.07,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 201,
    "start": 484.07,
    "end": 484.91,
    "text": "Thank you so much."
  },
  {
    "id": 202,
    "start": 484.91,
    "end": 487.51,
    "text": "I'm so impressed by you, wow."
  },
  {
    "id": 203,
    "start": 487.51,
    "end": 489.19,
    "text": "Congratulations Sophie, well done."
  },
  {
    "id": 204,
    "start": 489.19,
    "end": 491.57,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 205,
    "start": 491.57,
    "end": 493.05,
    "text": "I'm very overwhelmed."
  },
  {
    "id": 206,
    "start": 493.05,
    "end": 496.53,
    "text": "And I'm really excited that I got a deal with Lauren Damon"
  },
  {
    "id": 207,
    "start": 496.53,
    "end": 499.17,
    "text": "and I'm just, I'm in heaven."
  },
  {
    "id": 208,
    "start": 499.17,
    "end": 500.61,
    "text": "I mean, I'm so excited."
  }
]